/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Dzukou Valley, located on the border of Nagaland and Manipur, is known for its lush green landscapes, seasonal flowers, and serene environment. The valley is particularly famous for the Dzukou lily, which is unique to this region. The best time to visit is from June to September for the blooming flowers and from October to March for pleasant weather. The valley offers a mix of meadows, streams, and panoramic views of the surrounding hills.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [4]
>>
